Our goal is to become a global leader in innovative virtual events that enhance engagement and connectivity, making impactful and memorable
experiences accessible to all.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

